WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Reverse Spin Kick hits Ryu as a Punish Counter beside the wall.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:02.650
Crouching heavy kick catches the crumpling opponent.

3
00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:03.150
The sweep target follow-up continues the corner juggle.

4
00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:04.600
Heavy Somersault Kick finishes the meterless route.

5
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:04.850
Ryu lands beside the wall.
